# BP148 D-BP148-017 untracked triage -----------------------------------------
# Scratch/working directory: SEG verification scripts, tsc/build logs, probe
# receipts, screenshots. 79 files already tracked in this dir stay tracked
# (.gitignore never affects already-tracked paths) -- this only stops NEW
# scratch files here from showing up in `git status`. Blast radius: everything
# under scratchpad/, and nothing outside it.
scratchpad/

# Root-level tsc/build log scratch (BP145 P1 session), same class as the logs
# already caught by scratchpad/ above but written outside it. Explicit paths
# only -- blast radius: these 4 files, nothing else at root.
.kn_bp145_p1_build_main.txt
.kn_bp145_p1_tsc_baseline.txt
.kn_bp145_p1_tsc_mainconfig.txt
.kn_bp145_p1_tsc_out.txt

# Electron test-profile userdata directory (BP145 M3), same class as the
# *_isolated_userdata/ dirs already caught under scratchpad/. Explicit path
# only -- blast radius: this one directory.
.kn_bp145m3_test_userdata/

# Root-level scratch verification script (BP141-7), self-describes as
# read-only replay/debug, not production wiring. Explicit path only --
# blast radius: this one file.
KN-BP141-7_verification_replay.mjs

# KN-BP141-9 verification harness files, self-labeled in their own header
# comments as "scratch, not part of the shipped app", left inside
# src/renderer/ instead of scratchpad/. Explicit paths only -- blast radius:
# these 3 files; src/renderer/'s other ~208 tracked source files are untouched.
src/renderer/kn_bp141_9_harness.html
src/renderer/kn_bp141_9_harness.tsx
src/renderer/kn_bp141_9_receipt_031.json
